# Dolby music preset artwork

Rounded genre vectors are reused from the approved XiaomiParts artwork. Lucide revision `70562c1ee1c4fdcf736fe97bc893fb8511927934`: disc-3, piano, mic-vocal, audio-lines, hand-metal and sliders-vertical. ISC and Feather attribution: lucide-LICENSE.txt.

Electric guitar, saxophone and harmonica supplements, plus the speaker portrait/landscape symbols, are app-authored Apache-2.0 vectors. All use a 24-unit grid, 2-unit rounded strokes. These vectors are decorative; localized labels and native option IDs determine behavior.
